// THE DEALER (docs/199, user 2026-09-30): the Black Market dealer is the FINAL BOSS.
//
// "make the black market dealer the final boss ... two states ... he can melee you
// with a scythe, shoot the Wunderwaffe and shock everyone, and then also shoot a
// machine gun" and, on the reel, "levitate. That's his walking animation."
//
// HIS OWN FACE (user 2026-10-02: "redesign the black market dealer away from
// Richtofen ... He will be his own entity. At half health his mask will be
// cracked and one eye glow will be missing and his smile more menacing"): the
// mask never comes off and nobody is under it. STATE TWO is the SAME Dealer
// wearing the CRACKED mask (tod_dealer_body_cracked: the right X eye dead, a
// chip torn from the temple, fissures, the grin torn wider with fangs;
// tools/dealer_boss/10_state2_mask.py).
//
// FIRST PASS (2026-10-01, user: "spawn him in the crown so i can test"): the
// character in the game. He is aitype spawner_tod_dealer (archetype "dealer",
// tools/dealer_boss/install.py), on the Keeper's skeleton with the Keeper's tree,
// so the stock zombie services drive him: find flesh, move, the melee swipe. His
// clips are his own (author_clips.py): STATE ONE (zombie_arms_position "up") is
// the masked Dealer LEVITATING with the scythe held in both hands; STATE TWO
// ("down", from the mask crack at TOD_DEALER_MASK_CRACK of his health) is the
// cracked-mask Dealer on the ground with the machine gun. The selector tables key
// on that one field, so the state flip is one write plus the body swap.
//
// This module supplies what the Keeper's supplies for the Keeper: the archetype's
// blackboard + zombie flags (reused from _tod_keeper - same skeleton, same tree),
// the tree's death StartFunction (dealerDeathStart), the spawn, the two states,
// the weapon in hand (a rigid model on tag_weapon_right; the hold is baked into
// the clips), the freeze under a card deal, the reward and the cleanup.
//
// WEAPON PASS (2026-10-07): warned Wunderwaffe strikes and fixed-aim Dingo bursts. No adds.
// He spawns in the crown hall for the user's test only while TOD_DEALER_TEST_SPAWN is 1.
//
// HIS LOOK AND HIS SOUND (W2B, asset packs PK10 + PK11, 2026-10-05): every effect rides a tag_origin CARRIER
// (never a bare PlayFX, never PlayFXOnTag on the actor), every one GENERATED by tools/dealer_fx/gen_fx.py, every
// sound GENERATED by tools/dealer_sfx/make_sounds.py (sound/aliases/tod_dealer.csv, 3D):
//   THE ARRIVAL   a black rift column tears up at the spot he rises through and swallows the moment he appears,
//                 a red neon flare in its heart (fx_tod_dealer_arrive) + the rift's tear (tod_dealer_spawn).
//   THE SHADOW    the black soul smoke peeling off his coat the whole fight (fx_tod_dealer_aura on a carrier linked
//                 to j_spine4) and a black mist pool at his feet he leaves behind (fx_tod_dealer_aura_trail on his
//                 tag_origin); the hum of his levitation under state one (tod_dealer_levitate_lp, his own loop).
//   HIS BLOWS     his clips' own Sound notes (tools/dealer_boss/install.py NOTE_ALIASES): the scythe swing, his
//                 effort, the gun swung like a club, his boots; a blow that LANDS rings (dealer_hit_cb).
//   THE CRACK     the mask shatters at his face (fx_tod_dealer_mask_shatter on tag_eye), the right eye's wire
//                 sputters out (fx_tod_dealer_eye_die at the right socket), the shadow turns hot red
//                 (fx_tod_dealer_aura_cracked), the hum dies, the crack + shriek (tod_dealer_mask_crack).
//   HIS DEATH     the burst under him (fx_tod_dealer_death: shards, a black soul column, embers, a dark shock
//                 ring) with the collapsing scream (tod_dealer_death); the body burns away (fx_tod_dealer_dissolve)
//                 and is deleted UNDER the last black billow, never blinking out.
//
// THE DEALER'S HOUSE (docs/207, 2026-10-04): his fight is the Battle Arena's level 10 now
// (_tod_house.gsc spawns him through spawn_boss in his own arena). level.tod_dealer_hold holds
// him in place while he talks (brain: ignoreall, the idle plays); level.tod_dealer_crack_fn /
// level.tod_dealer_death_fn are his voice's hooks at the crack and the end.
//
// Logs: [TOD_DEALER] INIT / TEST_SPAWN / SPAWN / READY / WEAPON / HP / STATE /
// FREEZE / STUCK / DEATH_START / DEATH, each with the numbers behind it; the look and
// sound: AURA (state, carriers) / FX (effect, tag, carrier) / FX_DROPPED / HIT (a landed
// blow's ring) / DISSOLVE / CORPSE_GONE.

#using scripts\codescripts\struct;
#using scripts\shared\array_shared;
#using scripts\shared\clientfield_shared;
#using scripts\shared\flag_shared;
#using scripts\shared\spawner_shared;
#using scripts\shared\system_shared;
